{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dd6c54c1-81ff-89ba-9fc8-974f085f042e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-14T12:10:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I want to ask about a dumpster. On the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Are you looking to have a dumpster placed on the street in front of your home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. But it's a no-parking zone there. So I wanted to know what the rules are for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Can I get the location first? What's the address where it would go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-eight Brewer Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:07:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-eight Brewer. Okay. And are you the owner there, or are you renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. The landlord said it's fine, he wants the old porch boards gone. But he said I should call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's reasonable. So generally, a dumpster that sits on a city street needs a street permit, and that applies whether or not it's a no-parking spot. In a no-parking zone they'll look at it more closely, because it can affect traffic or visibility. Is the sign right at your house, or down the block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:07:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in front. There's a sign on the pole. I don't know the hours on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that matters. If you can read me what it says, I can note it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would have to go look. I can't see it from the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, you don't have to do it now. When you apply, they'll want the sign hours, the size of the dumpster, and how many days it will be there. Do you know the company yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not yet. I thought I should ask the city first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good order to do it in. Usually the hauling company knows the process and can tell you the size you need. Then the permit is requested for that placement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the fee. Is there a fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a fee for the street permit. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and it can depend on how many days it's out there. The office that issues it can give you the number when you apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Who would I ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can transfer you, or I can take your name and number and have someone call you back. Which do you prefer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call back is good. I have to help my grandson with his homework in a minute. He's learning cursive. He doesn't like the loops."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, the loops are the hard part. Okay, let me take your name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yesenia Morales. M-O-R-A-L-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven one. Got it. And I'm noting twenty-eight Brewer Street, dumpster on the street, no-parking zone in front. Is there a day you want it delivered?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe next week. Not sure. It depends on the permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that. Someone should reach you within a day or two. If you read the sign before then, have the hours ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Morales. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T12:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
